---
import Eyebrow from './Eyebrow.astro';
---
<section class="section relative overflow-hidden border-y hairline">
  <div class="bg-grid opacity-30!" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative">
    <Eyebrow label="Client words" />
    <figure class="mt-10">
      <blockquote>
        <p class="max-w-[26ch] text-[clamp(1.9rem,4.4vw,4.5rem)] font-medium leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.035em]" data-scrub>
          “UX Labs didn’t just make our customer profiles look good. They understood what we were trying to build and turned our ideas into a clean, intuitive experience that finally felt like WizeSage.”
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="mt-12 flex items-center gap-4" data-reveal>
        <img src="/img/hasitha.webp" alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy" class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover grayscale" />
        <div>
          <p class="font-medium">Hasitha Manjitha</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/50">CEO &amp; Founder, WizeSage</p>
        </div>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
